Jack Bolsen <jbolsen@verizon.net> writes:

> That being the case, it seems to me that twoweapon combat is a nice
> novelty but not overly useful. Using one weapon gives the advantage of
> using a shield, which I can use for reflection (freeing my amulet spot for
