A drawback with a shield is that if both the shield and your primary
weapon get cursed, you can't take anything out of any container.
Which means that you can't reach the scrolls of remove curse stashed in
your bag to keep them safe from getting cursed or burned.
This isn't often a problem in the early game, but things change after you
have waken up Rodney and fetched the Amulet..
Therefore, I usually don't bother with shields except for the early game.

